    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Cn1027">Cn 1027</ref> 9</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Quapropter Deo omnipotenti gratias magnificas reddo, quia omnia, quae desideraveram prout mente decreveram, prospere perfeci votisque meis ad velle satisfeci.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Therefore, I render supreme thanks to Almighty God, because, in accordance with my intention, I have successfully accomplished all that I had desired, and have fulfilled my vows in accordance with my wish.</ab>
      </div>
